{
  "title": { "zh": "一个接一个" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "<level-ref to=\"1-9\"></level-ref>收的是这样的字节，这一次换到发送的一方。要送的字节排成一队，板只看得见排在最前面的那一个；队伍空了，看到的是「—」。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "1-10",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "把交来的字节依次送出，每个字节前加起始位 1，后加停止位 0；字节送完以后线上一直是 0。说「下一个」为 1 的那一拍取走眼前的字节，下一拍换上后一个。"
      },
      "hint": [
        { "zh": "一个字节连同起始位和停止位，一共占 10 拍。" },
        {
          "zh": "<part-ref to=\"serializer\"></part-ref>只说那 8 位，起始位那一拍要另外说。"
        },
        { "zh": "队伍空了以后，也不能再说起始位。" }
      ],
      "inputs": [{ "name": "byte", "label": { "zh": "队首" } }],
      "outputs": [{ "name": "next", "label": { "zh": "下一个" } }],
      "pulls": { "input": "byte", "next": "next" },
      "wires": { "out": [{ "name": "line", "label": { "zh": "出线" } }] },
      "tests": [
        { "ticks": 22, "queue": [[65]] },
        { "ticks": 32, "queue": [[0, 255]] },
        { "ticks": 12, "queue": [] }
      ],
      "hidden": [{ "ticks": 42, "queue": [[128, 1, 170]] }, { "ticks": 32, "queue": [[7], [9]] }],
      "want": { "line": { "sent": { "format": "startstop" } } },
      "solution": [
        "z = const[value=0]()",
        "o = const[value=1]()",
        "nine = const[value=9]()",
        "g = reg[reg=A, start=1]()",
        "c = counter(g)",
        "e0 = equal(c, z)",
        "e1 = equal(c, o)",
        "e9 = equal(c, nine)",
        "ka = keep[reg=A](e9)",
        "s = serializer(byte, e1)",
        "has = equal(byte, byte)",
        "l = select(e0, has, s.line)",
        "line <- l",
        "next <- e1"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "z = const[value=0]()",
        "o = const[value=1]()",
        "nine = const[value=9]()",
        "g = reg[reg=A, start=1]()",
        "c = counter(g)",
        "e0 = equal(c, z)",
        "e1 = equal(c, o)",
        "e9 = equal(c, nine)",
        "ka = keep[reg=A](e9)",
        "s = serializer(byte, e1)",
        "l = select(e0, o, s.line)",
        "line <- l",
        "next <- e1"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
